ty-90 hover:-translate-y-px no-underline font-medium bg-primary-dark text-white rounded-[20px] border border-primary-border shadow-btn text-label px-3 py-2 flex-1">Dashboard<svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5.5 3.5L9 7l-3.5 3.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></a></div></div></header><div class="h-[68px]" aria-hidden="true"></div><main class="relative"><article class="bg-surface"><div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[1440px] px-5 pb-16 pt-28 sm:px-8 sm:pb-20 sm:pt-24 lg:px-10 xl:pb-48"><a class="font-mono text-[11px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-primary-mid hover:underline" href="/gateway/models">All models</a><div class="mt-6 grid items-start gap-8 xl:grid-cols-[11.5rem_minmax(0,1fr)_360px] xl:gap-x-10"><div class="min-w-0 xl:col-start-2 xl:row-start-1"><header class="flex items-start gap-4"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="40" height="40" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="mt-1 h-10 w-10 object-contain" style="color:transparent" src="/images/gateway/providers/nvidia.png"/><div class="min-w-0"><p class="font-mono text-[11px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-muted">NVIDIA</p><h1 class="mt-1 font-serif text-[40px] leading-none text-navy sm:text-[52px]">Parakeet TDT 0.6B v3</h1></div></header><section class="mt-8" aria-labelledby="model-about"><h2 id="model-about" class="font-serif text-[28px] text-navy">About</h2><p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl text-body-md leading-relaxed text-navy/80">Parakeet TDT 0.6B v3 is a 0.6B open-weight model from NVIDIA. NeMo Parakeet speech-to-text transcription. It accepts text, images, and video. Released August 4, 2025.</p></section><ul class="mt-6 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-3"><li class="rounded-xl border border-border bg-white px-4 py-5"><p class="font-mono text-[10px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-muted">Parameters</p><p class="mt-3 font-serif text-[36px] leading-none text-navy"