10h.01"></path><path d="M8 10h.01"></path><path d="M12 14h.01"></path><path d="M8 14h.01"></path><path d="M12 18h.01"></path><path d="M8 18h.01"></path></svg>Estimate cost</a><a href="#quickstart" class="flex items-center gap-2.5 rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-sm transition-colors text-muted hover:bg-white/80 hover:text-navy"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-code-xml size-4 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m18 16 4-4-4-4"></path><path d="m6 8-4 4 4 4"></path><path d="m14.5 4-5 16"></path></svg>Quick start</a><a href="#response" class="flex items-center gap-2.5 rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-sm transition-colors text-muted hover:bg-white/80 hover:text-navy"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-braces size-4 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 3H7a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v5a2 2 0 0 1-2 2 2 2 0 0 1 2 2v5c0 1.1.9 2 2 2h1"></path><path d="M16 21h1a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-5c0-1.1.9-2 2-2a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-1"></path></svg>Response</a></nav><aside aria-label="Model specifications" class="rounded-xl border border-border bg-white xl:sticky xl:top-24 xl:max-h-[calc(100vh-6.5rem)] xl:overflow-y-auto xl:col-start-3 xl:row-span-2 xl:row-start-1 xl:self-start"><h2 class="border-b border-border px-4 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-navy">Model specifications</h2><dl class="px-4"><div class="grid grid-cols-[9.25rem_minmax(0,1fr)] items-start gap-3 border-b border-border py-3 last:border-b-0"><dt class="pt-0.5 text-sm text-muted">Provider</dt><dd class="min-w-0 text-sm font-medium text-navy"><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="16" height="16" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-4 w-4 object-contain" style="color:t