2-.432L16 10.5"></path><rect x="2" y="6" width="14" height="12" rx="2"></rect></svg></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute bottom-full left-1/2 z-20 mb-1.5 hidden -translate-x-1/2 whitespace-nowrap rounded-[6px] bg-navy px-2 py-1 font-mono text-[10px] text-white shadow-[0_6px_20px_rgba(15,23,42,0.18)] group-hover/input:block group-focus-within/input:block">video_url</span></span></div></dd></div><div class="grid grid-cols-[9.25rem_minmax(0,1fr)] items-start gap-3 border-b border-border py-3 last:border-b-0"><dt class="pt-0.5 text-sm text-muted">License</dt><dd class="min-w-0 text-sm font-medium text-navy">CC-BY-4.0</dd></div><div class="grid grid-cols-[9.25rem_minmax(0,1fr)] items-start gap-3 border-b border-border py-3 last:border-b-0"><dt class="pt-0.5 text-sm text-muted">Released</dt><dd class="min-w-0 text-sm font-medium text-navy">August 4, 2025</dd></div></dl><div class="flex flex-col gap-2 border-t border-border p-4"><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 cursor-pointer transition-[transform,box-shadow,background-color,opacity] duration-300 ease-out hover:opacity-90 hover:-translate-y-px no-underline font-medium bg-primary-dark text-white rounded-[20px] border border-primary-border shadow-btn h-9 px-3 text-sm leading-4 w-full" type="button">Playground</button><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 cursor-pointer transition-[transform,box-shadow,background-color,opacity] duration-300 ease-out hover:opacity-90 hover:-translate-y-px no-underline font-medium bg-transparent text-navy border border-navy/20 rounded-lg h-9 px-3 text-sm leading-4 w-full" type="button">Use model</button></div></aside><div class="min-w-0 space-y-12 xl:col-start-2 xl:row-start-2"><section id="pricing" class="scroll-mt-28" aria-labelledby="pricing-heading"><h2 id="pricing-heading" class="font-serif text-[28px] text-navy">Pricing</h2><p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">Token rates are US dollars per 1M tokens. Image rates are per 1K images. Audio rates are per 1M audio seconds.</p><div class="mt-4 overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-border bg-white"><table class="w-full min-w-[420px] border-collapse text-left text-sm"><thead><tr class="border-b border-border"><th class="px-4 py-3 font-mono text-[10px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-muted">Rate</th><th class="px-4 py-3 font-mono text-[10px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-muted">Price</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class="border-b border-border last:border-b-0"><td class="px-4 py-3 text-navy">Per 1M audio seconds</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-navy">$16.67</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section id="compare" class="scroll-mt-28" aria-labelledby="compare-heading"><h2 id="compare-heading" class="font-serif text-[28px] text-navy">Compare</h2><p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">Parakeet TDT 0.6B v3 is the only transcription model in the catalog. The other rows take similar inputs and do a different job.</p><div class="mt-4 overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-border bg-white"><table class="w-full min-w-[640px] border-collapse text-left text-sm"><thead><tr class="border-b border-border"><th class="px-4 py-3 font-mono text-[10px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-muted">Model</th><th class="px-4 py-3 font-mono text-[10px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-muted">What it does</th><th class="px-4 py-3 font-mono text-[10px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-muted">Price</th><th class="px-4 py-3 font-mono text-[10px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-muted">Parameters</th><th class="px-4 py-3 font-mono text-[10px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-muted">Context</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class="border-b border-border last:border-b-0"><td class="px-4 py-3 text-navy"><span class="font-medium text-navy">Parakeet TDT 0.6B v3</span></td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-navy">NeMo Parakeet speech-to-text transcription.</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-navy">$16.67 / 1M audio seconds</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-navy">0.6B</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-navy">—</td></tr><tr class="border-b border-border last:border-b-0"><td class="px-4 py-3 text-navy"><a class="text-primary-mid hover:underline" href="/gateway/models/paddleocr-pp-ocrv6">PP-OCRv6</a></td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-navy">PaddleOCR PP-OCRv6 medium text detection and recognition; scene OCR JSONL on image chat; text returns plain text; document_url fan-out via text.</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-navy">$0.02 / 1M input</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-navy">20M</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-navy">—</td></tr><tr class="border-b border-border last:border-b-0"><td class="px-4 py-3 text-navy"><a class="text-primary-mid hover:underline" href="/gateway/models/google-gemini-3.5-flash-lite">Gemini 3.5 Flash Lite</a></td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-navy">Fastest and cheapest Gemini tier. Multimodal chat; emits no reasoning tokens.</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-navy">$0.30 / 1M input</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-navy">—</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-navy">1M</td></tr><tr class="border-b border-border last:border-b-0"><td class="px-4 py-3 text-navy"><a class="text-primary-mid hover:underline" href="/gateway/models/google-gemini-3.7-flash">Gemini 3.7 Flash</a></td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-navy">Newest Gemini Flash tier with extended reasoning. Multimodal chat + native video.</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-navy">$0.75 / 1M input</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-navy">—</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-navy">1M</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section id="benchmarks" class="scroll-mt-28" aria-labelledby="benchmarks-heading"><h2 id="benchmarks-heading" class="font-serif text-[28px] text-navy">Benchmarks</h2><p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">Published scores for <!-- -->Parakeet TDT 0.6B v3<!-- -->, from the<!-- --> <a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2509.14128" class="underline decoration-border underline-offset-2 hover:text-navy">Parakeet paper</a>.</p><div class="mt-4 space-y-4"><figure class="rounded-xl border border-border bg-white p-4"><figcaption class="font-mono text-[11px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-muted">Evals</figcaption><ul class="mt-4 space-y-4"><li><div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-3"><a href="https://huggingface.co/spaces/hf-audio/open_asr_leaderboard" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-sm text-navy underline decoration-border underline-offset-2 hover:text-navy">Open ASR avg WER</a><span class="font-mono text-sm text-navy">6.32</span></div><div class="mt-2 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-violet-400/15" role="img" aria-label="Open ASR avg WER: Parakeet TDT 0.6B v3 6.32"><div class="h-full rounded-full bg-violet-500" style="width:31.6%"></div></div></li><li><div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-3"><a href="https://groups.inf.ed.ac.uk/ami/corpus/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-sm text-navy underline decoration-border underline-offset-2 hover:text-navy">AMI WER</a><span class="font-mono text-sm text-navy">11.39</span></div><div class="mt-2 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-violet-400/15" role="img" aria-label="AMI WER: Parakeet TDT 0.6B v3 11.39"><div class="h-full rounded-full bg-violet-500" style="width:56.95%"></div></div></li><li><div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-3"><a href="https://www.openslr.org/12" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-sm text-navy underline decoration-border underline-offset-2 hover:text-navy">LibriSpeech other WER</a><span class="font-mono text-sm text-navy">3.59</span></div><div class="mt-2 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-violet-400/15" role="img" aria-label="LibriSpeech other WER: Parakeet TDT 0.6B v3 3.59"><div class="h-full rounded-full bg-violet-500" style="width:17.95%"></div></div></li></ul><p class="mt-4 text-xs text-muted">A lower score is better.</p></figure><div class="overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-border bg-white"><table class="w-full border-collapse text-left text-sm"><thead><tr class="border-b border-border"><th class="px-4 py-3 font-mono text-[10px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-muted">Reading</th><th class="px-4 py-3 font-mono text-[10px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-muted">Example</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class="border-b border-border"><td class="px-4 py-3 text-navy">Qualitative</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-navy">Clear structure, grounded in the input</td></tr><tr class="border-b border-border"><td class="px-4 py-3 text-navy">Quantitative</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-navy">Open ASR avg WER: 6.32.</td></tr><tr><td class="px-4 py-3 text-navy">Cost and performance</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-navy">Lower listed rate, mid-pack latency</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></section><section id="methods" class="scroll-mt-28" aria-labelledby="methods-heading"><h2 id="methods-heading" class="font-serif text-[28px] text-navy">Methods</h2><p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">Methods this model serves. Payload shapes are in the<!-- --> <a href="https://docs.vlm.run/gateway/methods" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-primary-mid hover:underline">docs</a>.</p><div class="mt-4 overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-border bg-white"><table class="w-full min-w-[420px] border-collapse text-left text-sm"><thead><tr class="border-b border-border"><th class="px-4 py-3 font-mono text-[10px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-muted">Method</th><th class="px-4 py-3 font-mono text-[10px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-muted">Returns</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class="border-b border-border last:border-b-0"><td class="px-4 py-3 text-navy"><span class="font-mono text-[13px]">transcribe</span></td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-navy">A transcript</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section id="supported-inputs" class="scroll-mt-28" aria-labelledby="supported-inputs-heading"><h2 id="supported-inputs-heading" class="font-serif text-[28px] text-navy">Supported inputs</h2><div class="mt-3 space-y-4"><ul class="overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-border bg-white"><li class="border-b border-border px-4 py-3 last:border-b-0"><div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4"><span class="font-mono text-[13px] text-navy">Audio upload (file)</span><span class="shrink-0 rounded-md px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.12em] bg-primary-tint-badge text-navy">Yes</span></div><p class="mt-1 max-w-3xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">One file per request, as multipart form data.</p></li><li class="border-b border-border px-4 py-3 last:border-b-0"><div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4"><span class="font-mono text-[13px] text-navy">Audio URL (url)</span><span class="shrink-0 rounded-md px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.12em] bg-primary-tint-badge text-navy">Yes</span></div><p class="mt-1 max-w-3xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">A hosted file, in place of <code class="rounded bg-navy/[0.06] px-1 py-0.5 font-mono text-[0.92em] text-navy">file</code>.</p></li><li class="border-b border-border px-4 py-3 last:border-b-0"><div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4"><span class="font-mono text-[13px] text-navy">Video container</span><span class="shrink-0 rounded-md px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.12em] bg-primary-tint-badge text-navy">Yes</span></div><p class="mt-1 max-w-3xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">An <code class="rounded bg-navy/[0.06] px-1 py-0.5 font-mono text-[0.92em] text-navy">mp4</code>, <code class="rounded bg-navy/[0.06] px-1 py-0.5 font-mono text-[0.92em] text-navy">mov</code>, <code class="rounded bg-navy/[0.06] px-1 py-0.5 font-mono text-[0.92em] text-navy">webm</code>, or <code class="rounded bg-navy/[0.06] px-1 py-0.5 font-mono text-[0.92em] text-navy">mkv</code> upload or URL is accepted and its audio track is transcribed.</p></li><li class="border-b border-border px-4 py-3 last:border-b-0"><div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4"><span class="font-mono text-[13px] text-navy">text, image_url, document_url</span><span class="shrink-0 rounded-md px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.12em] bg-rose-700/10 text-rose-800">No</span></div><p class="mt-1 max-w-3xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">This model is not a chat model. A chat completion naming it is a <code class="rounded bg-navy/[0.06] px-1 py-0.5 font-mono text-[0.92em] text-navy">400</code>.</p></li></ul><ul class="max-w-3xl space-y-1.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted "><li class="flex gap-2"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-[0.55em] size-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-border"></span><span>Served over <a href="https://docs.vlm.run/gateway/api-reference/post-audio-transcriptions" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-primary-mid hover:underline"><code class="rounded bg-navy/[0.06] px-1 py-0.5 font-mono text-[0.92em] text-navy">POST /v1/openai/audio/transcriptions</code></a>. Only method: <code class="rounded bg-navy/[0.06] px-1 py-0.5 font-mono text-[0.92em] text-navy">transcribe</code>. <code class="rounded bg-navy/[0.06] px-1 py-0.5 font-mono text-[0.92em] text-navy">language</code> is an optional ISO-639-1 hint.</span></li><li class="flex gap-2"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-[0.55em] size-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-border"></span><span>Billed per audio second on <code class="rounded bg-navy/[0.06] px-1 py-0.5 font-mono text-[0.92em] text-navy">json</code> and <code class="rounded bg-navy/[0.06] px-1 py-0.5 font-mono text-[0.92em] text-navy">verbose_json</code> replies. See <a href="https://docs.vlm.run/gateway/pricing" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-primary-mid hover:underline">Pricing</a>.</span></li><li class="flex gap-2"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-[0.55em] size-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-border"></span><span>Weights: <a href="https://huggingface.co/nvidia/parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v3" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-primary-mid hover:underline"><code class="rounded bg-navy/[0.06] px-1 py-0.5 font-mono text-[0.92em] text-navy">nvidia/parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v3</code></a>.</span></li></ul></div></section><section id="cost" class="scroll-mt-28" aria-label="Estimate cost"><h2 class="font-serif text-[28px] text-navy">Estimate cost</h2><div class="mt-4 rounded-xl border border-border bg-white p-4"><div class="grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2"><label class="block text-sm text-navy">Hours of audio<input type="number" min="0" step="0.1" class="mt-1 h-9 w-full rounded-lg border border-border bg-surface px-3 font-mono text-sm text-navy outline-none focus:border-primary" value="1000"/></label></div><p class="mt-3 border-t border-border pt-3 text-right font-serif text-[32px] leading-none text-navy" data-testid="model-cost">$60.01</p></div></section><section id="quickstart" class="scroll-mt-28" aria-labelledby="quickstart-heading"><h2 id="quickstart-heading" class="font-serif text-[28px] text-navy">Quick start</h2><p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">Call this model on the OpenAI-compatible gateway. The model id is already filled in.</p><div class="mt-3 space-y-4"><div class="group relative w-full min-w-0 overflow-hidden border border-black/[0.08] bg-white/60 shadow-[0_8px_30px_rgba(16,42,86,0.04)] backdrop-blur-[4px] rounded-[12px]"><div class="flex h-8 items-center justify-between border-b px-3 border-black/[0.06] bg-white/20"><div class="flex h-full min-w-0 items-stretch gap-3"><div class="flex h-full items-stretch gap-4"><button type="button" class="relative flex h-8 items-center font-mono text-[11px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.14em] leading-[144%] transition-all duration-200 text-muted "><span class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 h-px bg-primary/50"></span>Python</button><button type="button" class="relative flex h-8 items-center font-mono text-[11px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.14em] leading-[144%] transition-all duration-200 text-muted/40 hover:text-muted/70 ">Node.js</button><button type="button" class="relative flex h-8 items-center font-mono text-[11px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.14em] leading-[144%] transition-all duration-200 text-muted/40 hover:text-muted/70 ">CLI</button><button type="button" class="relative flex h-8 items-center font-mono text-[11px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.14em] leading-[144%] transition-all duration-200 text-muted/40 hover:text-muted/70 ">cURL</button></div></div><button type="button" class="flex shrink-0 cursor-pointer items-center gap-1.5 rounded p-1.5 text-[11px] font-medium transition-colors duration-200 text-muted/60 hover:text-navy" aria-label="Copy code"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="4" y="4" width="7" height="7" rx="1" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2"></rect><path d="M3 8H2a1 1 0 01-1-1V2a1 1 0 011-1h5a1 1 0 011 1v1" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2"></path></svg></button></div><div class="flex min-w-0 w-full overflow-x-auto lg:no-scrollbar min-h-[320px] px-4 py-3.5 bg-transparent"><pre class="min-w-0 flex-1 whitespace-pre font-mono text-[12px] leading-[16px]"><code class="block min-w-max"><span class="text-[#0000ff]">from</span><span class="text-[#000000]"> openai </span><span class="text-[#0000ff]">import</span><span class="text-[#000000]"> OpenAI

client = OpenAI</span><span class="text-[#0431fa]">(</span><span class="text-[#000000]">
    base_url=</span><span class="text-[#a31515]">&quot;https://gateway.vlm.run/v1/openai&quot;</span><span class="text-[#000000]">,
    api_key=</span><span class="text-[#a31515]">&quot;&lt;VLMRUN_API_KEY&gt;&quot;</span><span class="text-[#000000]">,
</span><span class="text-[#0431fa]">)</span><span class="text-[#000000]">

</span><span class="text-[#0000ff]">with</span><span class="text-[#000000]"> open</span><span class="text-[#0431fa]">(</span><span class="text-[#a31515]">&quot;sample.mp3&quot;</span><span class="text-[#000000]">, </span><span class="text-[#a31515]">&quot;rb&quot;</span><span class="text-[#0431fa]">)</span><span class="text-[#000000]"> </span><span class="text-[#0000ff]">as</span><span class="text-[#000000]"> audio_file:
    response = client.audio.transcriptions.create</span><span class="text-[#0431fa]">(</span><span class="text-[#000000]">
        model=</span><span class="text-[#a31515]">&quot;nvidia/parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v3&quot;</span><span class="text-[#000000]">,
        file=audio_file,
    </span><span class="text-[#0431fa]">)</span><span class="text-[#000000]">

print</span><span class="text-[#0431fa]">(</span><span class="text-[#000000]">response.text</span><span class="text-[#0431fa]">)</span><span class="text-[#000000]">
</span></code></pre></div></div></div></section><section id="response" class="scroll-mt-28" aria-labelledby="response-heading"><h2 id="response-heading" class="font-serif text-[28px] text-navy">Response</h2><div class="mt-3 space-y-4"><p class="max-w-3xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted"><code class="rounded bg-navy/[0.06] px-1 py-0.5 font-mono text-[0.92em] text-navy">response_format</code> defaults to <code class="rounded bg-navy/[0.06] px-1 py-0.5 font-mono text-[0.92em] text-navy">json</code>, which carries the transcript and a <code class="rounded bg-navy/[0.06] px-1 py-0.5 font-mono text-[0.92em] text-navy">usage</code> block:</p><div class="group relative w-full min-w-0 overflow-hidden border border-black/[0.08] bg-white/60 shadow-[0_8px_30px_rgba(16,42,86,0.04)] backdrop-blur-[4px] rounded-[12px]"><div class="flex h-8 items-center justify-between border-b px-3 border-black/[0.06] bg-white/20"><div class="flex h-full min-w-0 items-stretch gap-3"><div class="flex h-full items-stretch gap-4"><button type="button" disabled="" class="relative flex h-8 items-center font-mono text-[11px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.14em] leading-[144%] transition-all duration-200 text-muted cursor-default"><span class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 h-px bg-primary/50"></span>JSON</button></div></div><button type="button" class="flex shrink-0 cursor-pointer items-center gap-1.5 rounded p-1.5 text-[11px] font-medium transition-colors duration-200 text-muted/60 hover:text-navy" aria-label="Copy code"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="4" y="4" width="7" height="7" rx="1" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2"></rect><path d="M3 8H2a1 1 0 01-1-1V2a1 1 0 011-1h5a1 1 0 011 1v1" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2"></path></svg></button></div><div class="flex min-w-0 w-full overflow-x-auto lg:no-scrollbar min-h-[320px] px-4 py-3.5 bg-transparent"><pre class="min-w-0 flex-1 whitespace-pre font-mono text-[12px] leading-[16px]"><code class="block min-w-max"><span class="text-[#0431fa]">{</span><span class="text-[#000000]">
  </span><span class="text-[#001080]">&quot;id&quot;</span><span class="text-[#000000]">: </span><span class="text-[#a31515]">&quot;transcription-3d1df87d0037&quot;</span><span class="text-[#000000]">,
  </span><span class="text-[#001080]">&quot;object&quot;</span><span class="text-[#000000]">: </span><span class="text-[#a31515]">&quot;audio.transcription&quot;</span><span class="text-[#000000]">,
  </span><span class="text-[#001080]">&quot;model&quot;</span><span class="text-[#000000]">: </span><span class="text-[#a31515]">&quot;nvidia/parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v3&quot;</span><span class="text-[#000000]">,
  </span><span class="text-[#001080]">&quot;backend&quot;</span><span class="text-[#000000]">: </span><span class="text-[#a31515]">&quot;nemo&quot;</span><span class="text-[#000000]">,
  </span><span class="text-[#001080]">&quot;task&quot;</span><span class="text-[#000000]">: </span><span class="text-[#a31515]">&quot;transcribe&quot;</span><span class="text-[#000000]">,
  </span><span class="text-[#001080]">&quot;duration&quot;</span><span class="text-[#000000]">: </span><span class="text-[#098658]">252.726</span><span class="text-[#000000]">,
  </span><span class="text-[#001080]">&quot;text&quot;</span><span class="text-[#000000]">: </span><span class="text-[#a31515]">&quot;McKeys Rocks is a rough and tumble area just outside Pittsburgh…&quot;</span><span class="text-[#000000]">,
  </span><span class="text-[#001080]">&quot;usage&quot;</span><span class="text-[#000000]">: </span><span class="text-[#319331]">{</span><span class="text-[#000000]">
    </span><span class="text-[#001080]">&quot;type&quot;</span><span class="text-[#000000]">: </span><span class="text-[#a31515]">&quot;duration&quot;</span><span class="text-[#000000]">,
    </span><span class="text-[#001080]">&quot;input_audio_seconds&quot;</span><span class="text-[#000000]">: </span><span class="text-[#098658]">252.726</span><span class="text-[#000000]">,
    </span><span class="text-[#001080]">&quot;input_tokens&quot;</span><span class="text-[#000000]">: </span><span class="text-[#098658]">0</span><span class="text-[#000000]">,
    </span><span class="text-[#001080]">&quot;output_tokens&quot;</span><span class="text-[#000000]">: </span><span class="text-[#098658]">581</span><span class="text-[#000000]">,
    </span><span class="text-[#001080]">&quot;total_tokens&quot;</span><span class="text-[#000000]">: </span><span class="text-[#098658]">581</span><span class="text-[#000000]">,
    </span><span class="text-[#001080]">&quot;cost&quot;</span><span class="text-[#000000]">: </span><span class="text-[#098658]">0.004213</span><span class="text-[#000000]">
  </span><span class="text-[#319331]">}</span><span class="text-[#000000]">
</span><span class="text-[#0431fa]">}</span><span class="text-[#000000]">
</span></code></pre></div></div><p class="max-w-3xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted"><code class="rounded bg-navy/[0.06] px-1 py-0.5 font-mono text-[0.92em] text-navy">usage.cost</code> is the metered charge in USD, and <code class="rounded bg-navy/[0.06] px-1 py-0.5 font-mono text-[0.92em] text-navy">input_audio_seconds</code> is the quantity it was computed from: the clip&#x27;s duration at $0.06 per audio hour. See <a href="https://docs.vlm.run/gateway/pricing#transcription" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-primary-mid hover:underline">Pricing</a>.</p><div class="max-w-3xl rounded-xl border border-border bg-primary-tint-badge px-4 py-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-navy"><p class="font-mono text-[10px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-muted">Note</p><p class="mt-1">Only <code class="rounded bg-navy/[0.06] px-1 py-0.5 font-mono text-[0.92em] text-navy">json</code> and <code class="rounded bg-navy/[0.06] px-1 py-0.5 font-mono text-[0.92em] text-navy">verbose_json</code> carry a <code class="rounded bg-navy/[0.06] px-1 py-0.5 font-mono text-[0.92em] text-navy">usage</code> block. <code class="rounded bg-navy/[0.06] px-1 py-0.5 font-mono text-[0.92em] text-navy">text</code>, <code class="rounded bg-navy/[0.06] px-1 py-0.5 font-mono text-[0.92em] text-navy">srt</code>, and <code class="rounded bg-navy/[0.06] px-1 py-0.5 font-mono text-[0.92em] text-navy">vtt</code> return the transcript alone, so read the cost from one of the JSON formats if you need it.</p></div></div></section></div></div></div></article><section class="relative z-[11]" aria-labelledby="cta-headline"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0" aria-hidden="true"><div class="absolute top-0 left-0 right-0 bg-body" style="height:45%"></div><div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 bg-navy-dark" style="height:55%"><div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute top-0 bottom-0 border-x border-dark-border" style="left:max(20px, calc((var(--page-rail-